   "comments": [
    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "6089a13a248ef600739455eb",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": false,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png",
       "24x24": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png",
       "32x32": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png",
       "48x48": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Former user",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a13a248ef600739455eb",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>The messages currently have the fedora object URI, timestamp, and event type (although in a different vocabulary which will require some mapping).</p>\n\n<p>It looks easy to add the userID (which is populated in the JCR Event instance automatically), and it shouldn't be too hard to pass the client user agent like we currently pass the baseURL.</p>",
     "created": "30/Mar/15 5:15 PM",
     "id": "13826",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/11370/comment/13826",
     "updateAuthor": {
      "accountId": "6089a13a248ef600739455eb",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": false,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png",
       "24x24": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png",
       "32x32": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png",
       "48x48": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Former user",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a13a248ef600739455eb",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "updated": "30/Mar/15 5:15 PM"
    },
    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "6089a13a248ef600739455eb",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": false,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png",
       "24x24": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png",
       "32x32": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png",
       "48x48": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Former user",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a13a248ef600739455eb",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>I've added userID and userAgent to the JMS events being emitted:</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/pull/760\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/pull/760</a></p>\n\n<p>However, the userAgent is passed using the ObservationManager which has caused problems in the past.  I believe <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=5fca8a549592df00764ce49c\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"5fca8a549592df00764ce49c\" data-account-id=\"5fca8a549592df00764ce49c\" accountid=\"5fca8a549592df00764ce49c\" rel=\"noreferrer\">cb</a>'s fix for this will continue to work (see <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/pull/537\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/pull/537</a>), and I haven't been able to trigger a problem by doing thousands of POSTs like in the past.  But we should be careful to avoid a regression here.</p>",
     "created": "31/Mar/15 11:16 AM",
     "id": "13827",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/11370/comment/13827",
     "updateAuthor": {
